ved as a Prussian field marshal.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/leopold-i-prince-of-lippe"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/leopold-i-prince-of-lippe.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Leopold I, Prince of Lippe</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Leopold I was count and, from 1789, the first prince of Lippe, a small state in north-western Germany.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/leopold-ii"><span class="enc-name">Leopold II</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Leopold II was King of the Belgians from 1865 to 1909 and personal ruler of the Congo Free State, a regime notorious for its brutal exploitation.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/leopold-ii-grand-duke-of-tuscany"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/leopold-ii-grand-duke-of-tuscany.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Leopold II, Grand Duke of Tuscany</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Leopold II was the last reigning Grand Duke of Tuscany of the House of Habsburg-Lorraine, ruling from 1824 to 1859.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/leopold-ii-holy-roman-emperor"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/leopold-ii-holy-roman-emperor.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Leopold II, Holy Roman Emperor</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Leopold II, known in Tuscany as Peter Leopold, was a son of Francis Stephen of Lorraine and Maria Theresa who ruled the Grand Duchy of Tuscany from 1765 to 1790.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/leopold-iii-frederick-franz"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/leopold-iii-frederick-franz.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="